      "title": "From William Clowes & Sons [before 8 November 1880]1",
      "header_text": [
        "From William Clowes & Sons [before 8 November 1880]1William Clowes & Sons. | Limited. | Duke Street, Stamford Street, | London, S.E."
      ],
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "body_paragraph": 1,
          "text": "We are very much vexed that you should imagine for one moment that we should put aside your book for others: having always been treated with great courtesy by you it has been our strong wish to push forward your works with the greatest rapidity—the delay in this case has been with the Index-maker: we received the copy only this morning and before we got your letter had arranged for the whole of the proof to be out tonight: Hoping that this explanation will convince you that we are not to blame.",
          "html_class": "",
          "locator": "div#letter div.body-content; retained body block 1"
        },
        {
          "body_paragraph": 2,
          "text": "We are Sir | Yours faithfully | Wm Clowes & Sons ld.: | per E. [A] Clowes:",
          "html_class": "",
          "locator": "div#letter div.body-content; retained body block 2"
        },
        {
          "body_paragraph": 3,
          "text": "Ch: Darwin Esqre",
          "html_class": "",
          "locator": "div#letter div.body-content; retained body block 3"
        }
      ],
      "excluded_body_annotations_and_salutations": [
        {
          "class": "salute",
          "text": "Dear Sir,"
        }
      ],
      "body_container_count": 1,
      "used_whole_body_fallback": false,
      "editorial_summary": "Summary Explains delay in printing proofs [of Movement in plants?].",
      "editorial_footnotes": "Footnotes1The date is established by the year in which the firm William Clowes and Sons became ‘William Clowes and Sons Ltd.’, and by the relationship between this letter and the letter to R. F. Cooke, 8 November [1880]. 2Movement in plants.3The indexer was Matilda Smith.4CD’s letter has not been found.5Edward Arnott Clowes.",
      "letter_container_present": true
